  (121520, 217, 'committee meeting all
the time? I''m not sure.', 3207.204, 3209.744, NULL),
  (121521, 217, '- Yeah. That''s... wow, that''s
a profound question.', 3209.824, 3211.984, NULL),
  (121522, 217, 'And does a committee with just
one member meet also as a-', 3212.024, 3215.233, NULL),
  (121523, 217, '- Yeah, maybe it''s always
in session. I don''t know.', 3215.343, 3218.004, NULL),
  (121524, 217, 'So the claim is that there are
more committees than people.', 3218.404, 3224.764, NULL),
  (121525, 217, 'Okay. Suppose not. Well, then we
could make an association between the', 3224.844, 3228.804, NULL),
  (121526, 217, 'people and the committees. So
we would have every committee', 3228.844, 3232.324, NULL),
  (121527, 217, 'could be named after a
person in a one-to-one way.', 3232.744, 3236.704, NULL),
  (121528, 217, 'And I''m not saying that the person is on
the committee that''s named after them,', 3236.724, 3240.634, NULL),
  (121529, 217, 'or not on it, whatever. Maybe sometimes that
happens, sometimes it doesn''t. I don''t know.', 3240.664, 3244.524, NULL),
  (121530, 217, 'It doesn''t matter. But let''s form what I
call committee D, which consists of all the', 3244.544, 3250.124, NULL),
  (121531, 217, 'people that are not on the
committee that''s named after them.', 3250.164, 3256.584, NULL),
  (121532, 217, 'Okay. Maybe that''s everyone, maybe it''s no
one, maybe it''s half the people. It doesn''t', 3256.744, 3260.334, NULL),
  (121533, 217, 'matter. That''s a committee. It''s a set of
