  (121537, 217, 'committee of people who aren''t
on their own committee.', 3281.404, 3285.364, NULL),
  (121538, 217, 'And if she isn''t, then she
should be. So again, it''s a', 3285.444, 3288.364, NULL),
  (121539, 217, 'contradiction. So when I was teaching at
Oxford, one of my students came up with the', 3288.404, 3295.404, NULL),
  (121540, 217, 'following different
anthropomorphization of Cantor''s', 3295.444, 3299.404, NULL),
  (121541, 217, 'argument. Let''s consider
all possible fruit', 3299.484, 3303.324, NULL),
  (121542, 217, 'salads. We have a given
collection of fruits.', 3303.384, 3307.144, NULL),
  (121543, 217, 'You know, apples and oranges and grapes,
