  (121544, 217, 'some collection of those fruits. So
there''s the banana, pear, grape salad and', 3311.564, 3315.544, NULL),
  (121545, 217, 'so on. There are a lot of different
kinds of salad. Every set of fruits', 3315.604, 3319.144, NULL),
  (121546, 217, 'makes a salad, a fruit
