  (121653, 217, 'us about the nature of mathematical truth?', 3763.804, 3766.964, NULL),
  (121654, 217, '- Absolutely. It''s one of the most
profound developments in mathematical', 3767.104, 3771.004, NULL),
  (121655, 217, 'logic. I mean, the
incompleteness theorems is when', 3771.164, 3773.144, NULL),
  (121656, 217, 'mathematical logic, in my view,
