  (122406, 217, 'mathematical structure.
And so, what I call the', 6820.900, 6824.180, NULL),
  (122407, 217, 'structuralist attitude in
mathematics is that we should', 6824.440, 6828.360, NULL),
  (122408, 217, 'only care about our
mathematical structures up', 6828.420, 6832.340, NULL),
  (122409, 217, 'to isomorphism. If I have a mathematical
structure of a certain kind,', 6832.380, 6836.240, NULL),
  (122410, 217, 'and I make an exact copy of it
