  (123323, 217, '- But the surreal numbers are fundamentally
discontinuous as you''re worried about.', 10449.384, 10452.744, NULL),
  (123324, 217, 'What are the consequences of this?', 10452.784, 10454.224, NULL),
  (123325, 217, '- Right. So the surreal numbers
