  (124108, 217, 'ends. Eventually, you get to
omega times three, omega times', 13558.692, 13562.232, NULL),
  (124109, 217, 'four, and so on. And then the limit of
those numbers, the first number that', 13562.292, 13566.262, NULL),
  (124110, 217, 'comes after all those numbers
