  (125080, 219, 'are actually quite
easy to change.', 174.280, 176.000, NULL),
  (125081, 219, 'And one of the great gifts
of childhood, adolescence,', 176.000, 178.760, NULL),
  (125082, 219, 'and young adulthood is that
