  (125109, 219, 'around us, our
nervous system will', 247.450, 249.580, NULL),
  (125110, 219, 'shift into a mode in which
change isn''t just possible,', 249.580, 252.740, NULL),
  (125111, 219, 'but it''s probable.', 252.740, 254.150, NULL),
  (125112, 219, 'As I mentioned
before, the hallmark', 254.150, 256.570, NULL),
  (125113, 219, 'of the child nervous
system is change.', 256.570, 259.279, NULL),
  (125114, 219, 'It wants to change.', 259.279, 260.350, NULL),
  (125115, 219, 'One of the ways in which
we can all get plasticity', 260.350, 263.860, NULL),
  (125116, 219, 'at any stage
throughout the lifespan', 263.860, 266.020, NULL),
  (125117, 219, 'is through deficits
and impairments', 266.020, 267.940, NULL),
  (125118, 219, 'in what we call our sensory
apparati-- our eyes, our ears,', 267.940, 271.610, NULL),
  (125119, 219, 'our nose, our mouth.', 271.610, 272.720, NULL),
  (125120, 219, 'In individuals that
are blind from birth,', 272.720, 275.060, NULL),
  (125121, 219, 'the so-called occipital cortex,
the visual cortex in the back,', 275.060, 278.500, NULL),
  (125122, 219, 'becomes overtaken by hearing.', 278.500, 282.190, NULL),
  (125123, 219, 'The neurons there will start
to respond to sounds as well', 282.190, 285.430, NULL),
  (125124, 219, 'as Braille touch.', 285.430, 286.550, NULL),
  (125125, 219, 'And actually, there is one
